====Usage notes====
The frequentative and imperfectivizing suffixes are etymologically the same. The spelling-variant suffixes can be distinguished from the other suffixes by their iotation behavior, by the restriction of the second type to certain root-final consonants, and by the types of verbs they usually affect. Note also that in the spelling-variant type, an underlying root consonant that has been modified or deleted may reappear, as in {{m|ru|подска́кивать|g=impf}}, based on the root {{lang|ru|подскок-}}, which appears in iotated form in {{m|ru|подскочи́ть|g=pf}}. For all {{alt|ru|-ывать}}/-ивать suffixes, the stress is drawn onto the syllable before the suffix, and an {{lang|ru|о}} in that syllable usually changes into {{lang|ru|а}}.

